{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-13_end","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-13","title":"短暂齐聚","storyCode":"13-15","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-13_end.txt","sourceHash":"7dc97739b1d30fd644c45be5af2d637f9e8fba7ef3845c75a75167e285fdf055","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Dr.{@nickname}，等这场战争结束，我想再回一次卡兹戴尔。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停车，前方有异常情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，做好战斗准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——这种感觉，我们之前检修那些法阵的时候也偶尔遇到过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖阁下，这到底是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开战之后，谁也没有想到，这片土地被如此迅速地浇灌了这么多的鲜血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“现代战争”，呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔恐怕已经等到了仪式需要的所有条件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前那些战地中的晶石仅是与仪式共振的节点，这一路上，我都在寻找仪式的中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布伦特伍德，这座小镇，在血魔晦暗的计划中，必然有特殊的地位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos先生，你能处理吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是鲜血的王庭的古老手段，他们也确实为此做了充足准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要更多时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还没暴露行踪，也许能争取些时间，但——等等——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......火光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小镇里有交战的火光......会是谁？"},{"type":"narration","text":"看来他们比我们先一步抵达了这里。\n一场有些波折的会师。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“矿工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖阁下，您......要去做什么？您是要处理我们的敌人，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“矿工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"这里，这种力量——难道不是那位血魔阁下，对于全体萨卡兹的赐福吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“矿工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"他......祝福了我们的血脉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......女妖阁下，我也感觉到自己......似乎变强了一点点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"腕力？还是头脑？我自己都不知道，但是总感觉有种......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......增强力量的巫术祭坛。我们曾经见过。但无论是规模还是给人的感觉，都远不相同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos先生，这会不会有什么负面的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并不需要支付代价，起码这份代价，并不是由我们自己的躯体支付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您为什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒，对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你希望这份力量被用在什么地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"narration","text":"萨卡兹战士们越善战，战场上浇灌鲜血的效率就越高。无论是他们敌人的，还是自己的。\n仪式就能够得以延续。\n血魔大君已经在为决战做准备了，可是他们......特雷西斯的布置，真的仅仅是这么一个仪式？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法阵似乎已经受到了攻击，伴生的血魔造物正在失控。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里交给我们吧，Logos先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请您先去确认仪式的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，你与博士可以和我一起行动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会尽快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们打算把我们怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实之前就发现了，真正被俘的，是我们，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我太熟悉王庭军的那群家伙了，你们给人的感觉完全不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是叫阿米娅，对吧？你和这位博士，才是你们这支队伍的领袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明......看起来和我差不多大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感觉到，那位女妖的地位并不普通，这做不得假。但他为你们效力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前些日子，我还遇到过一位自称是萨卡兹的卡普里尼女士......她也是你们的成员吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们到底是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算和我们战斗吗，明椒小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，其实我不清楚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"队长，那位女妖阁下怎么走了？现在我们怎么办？地上的裂缝向我们蔓延过来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两个俘虏怎么被留下了？来自王庭的大人物这么信任我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......是啊！你们在那个方向做好警戒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看着这两个人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的力量也许变强了，但你们并不熟悉战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者说，你们谁都没准备好参与这场战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。这么长时间了，我们难道不知道吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是运输小队的队长！如果你们要做什么，就先拿我开刀好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们只是从泰拉各地响应殿下号召，卷进这场战争的普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们甚至只是在执行曼弗雷德将军委派的运输任务，完全不清楚自己在做什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从他们响应号召起......维多利亚人就不会再认为他们是普通人，明椒小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这和他们做了什么并没有关系。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是将军交到我手上的队员，无论发生什么，我会保护他们的安全，阿米娅小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我对曼弗雷德将军的承诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......将军，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那至少现在，让我们一起，解决掉眼前的这些失控的血液造物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你的队伍叫回来吧，明椒小姐，别心存侥幸，这些造物会吮干任何它们看见的血液。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，跟紧我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会用我的力量，为我们，为他们开路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，其实有种更快的方式堵死那些裂缝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“砰，砰，砰！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹雇佣兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脚下留神，毛线球，你站的可不是个好地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建议你在那个疯子扔炸弹的时候离她远点，W可不是什么善良的萨卡兹宝宝适合接触的对象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，伊内丝小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，还有，阿米——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，你的头上，那是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“黑色的王冠”？你是曼弗雷德将军说过的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说，曼弗雷德捡了个孩子，看来就是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几个萨卡兹也已经被我控制。你是他们的队长吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“矿工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，放开我！你......你到底是谁？你想干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在为军事委员会和王庭的大人物执行任务！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚好，我为他们整顿纪律。"},{"type":"narration","text":"你好，阿米娅。当然，还有......\n博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，第一次正式面对面交流，是不是觉得很失望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他当反派的时间确实要比当自己人的时间长了，我也不适应呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢您的帮助，赫德雷先生，其他事情我们可以之后再谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如您所见，这座小镇正成为一场争夺战的中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实。我们有些重要的情报需要和你们共享。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于这座小镇，和藏在它的阴影里的，“生命线”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有两支部队正在进攻那里的萨卡兹驻军，一支是可露希尔从伦蒂尼姆带出来的那些自救军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，看来我的安全屋是被糟蹋了，但愿那老女人没什么好下场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另一支是由曾隶属不同公爵的军人组成的部队......还有一些，难民和工人模样的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一支不像样的军队，而他们的领导人是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推进之王。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——救命——唔，唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司机”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“矿工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"别吭声，*萨卡兹粗口*。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是哪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚人？！还有......萨卡兹佣兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别怕，我还在这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情况，呃，确实有点复杂，但是听我的，准没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不会还想在后面的计划里继续带着这些累赘吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老财”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁是累赘？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐，我答应过明椒小姐不会伤害他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛，呵，老样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就让他们先和跟着我的那些佣兵们待在一起吧，那些家伙已经无所事事得够久了，正好给他们带带新人，找点乐子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得怎么样，蓝毛菲林，你瞪着我们好久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想把我们都杀了，你可以直接动手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不动手？啧啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们愿意继续僵持在这里我是无所谓，这些人我先带走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这待着心烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，伊内丝，要是你们和维多利亚人打起来，别忘了提前通知我一声，我不想错过好戏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事就好。我很担心，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......阿米娅小姐，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我愿意相信罗德岛挑选合作对象的标准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......我想......我也是情报人员。我对这位“赫德雷”不是一无所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对他......不，甚至是对Misery，对伊内丝，这一路上我都止不住去想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没法接受这件事，暂时没法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，也许我根本没办法接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是眼下，我说过了，我相信维娜的判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这是现在我们要做的，那就去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些伤痕不会被遗忘，也不该被遗忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以萨卡兹的战争从未在这片大地上结束过，菲林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掐断军事委员会的补给线，确实是我们一直以来的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，这都是让战争迅速结束的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是这只“巨兽”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道你在想什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在各方据点都不再安全的现在，这具骸骨可以成为我们反攻伦蒂尼姆的依仗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们无法与任何一支军事力量正面抗衡，更无法轻易躲开那艘飞空艇几近无可匹敌的火力覆盖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，这个“飘忽不定”的巨兽，就是最适合我们的载具，同时也是壁垒，甚至是一柄直达心脏的长矛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，如果我们成功了，它自然属于这场反攻战的领导人们，而不是......“萨卡兹雇佣兵”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们似乎没有拒绝合作的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“但是”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从理性的角度，我明白萨卡兹与萨卡兹之间并不等同，“典范军”也确实与身为萨卡兹的Misery先生配合无间，但......这是个人的友谊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也许能去尊敬，能去信任，甚至能去爱几个具体的人，但现在在我们面前的是一场每一方手上都沾满了血的战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们有足够的时间，也许可以逐一探究犯下了战争罪行的到底是哪些人，又有哪些人清白无辜，但这不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一场死局，赫德雷先生。我们的合作不会那么顺利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因如此，我们在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛会作为两方之间的调停者和沟通者行使职能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了维多利亚的人民不再受战争之苦，为了卡兹戴尔的萨卡兹不再继续被拖入深渊，这都正当。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不必强求握手言和，把一切都留到停下这场荒唐的战争之后吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"口号是无力的，最后停下这一切的，只会是我们的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......罗德岛就是这样的地方。听说赫德雷先生过去就和罗德岛有接触？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你提到了那只巨兽停靠的位置，有大量萨卡兹的驻军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是从计划的合理性来说，少量精锐要好过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好过工人和街头混混们正面送死，是吧？你可以把话说敞亮些，我没那么在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但跟着我的家伙们，不会错过任何能揍翻萨卡兹的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的战车会帮你们吸引驻军的火力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足够了，多谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米娅小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们第一次正式合作，与“罗德岛”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，赫德雷先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，请容许我问您一个问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的困扰和担忧，您刚才没说出口。您心底里的想法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是为了拯救更多的生命，制止战争和仇恨，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说，魔王可以轻易地洞察人心，和伊内丝那样模棱两可的感觉不同。我应该瞒不住你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我尊重一位从巴别塔时期挣扎奋斗至今的萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望您以您的意志回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会......争取那个未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您的答案，也，谢谢您的信任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos先生，凯尔希医生，你们回来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我分析了血魔的仪式，令人担忧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这确实是关乎血脉的赐福，使用的技艺古老而精准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大君借用巫术的力量，搜集战争中流淌的血，以此活性化萨卡兹战士们的血统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他无时无刻不在提醒萨卡兹与其他种族本质上的不同，除去增幅，更似劝诱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但最重要的是......恐怕这只占他在此收集的力量的一小部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更多的能量去向不明。我尝试追踪，但法术结构复杂凌乱，只指向伦蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在搞什么把戏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，这提醒了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此时此刻，战场中心，有一位比血魔更善于汲取并利用死亡的萨卡兹领袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的只是“增幅士兵”，那又如何轮得到鲜血王庭的巫术？又为什么要选择法阵这种形制？还连战争边缘的村镇都不放过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结论是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"飞空艇，巨兽，碎片大厦，还有眼前的巫术装置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博士的担忧是对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所说，那只巨兽会是我们最重要的突破口，行动必须尽快开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔也好，食腐者也罢，还有赦罪师反常地暴露在夜莺的面前，他们都在铤而走险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"战争不是无缘无故在此时打响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......特雷西斯在伦蒂尼姆还准备了最后的杀手锏。是啊，篡夺一国首都，本就荒诞不经......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可，会是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"先让我从一个基本的问题，开始解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"连萨卡兹自身都已经忘记了的，最基本的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“为什么萨卡兹是最容易感染矿石病的种族？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]}]}
